    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke Auctioneers are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom terraced home to the market, ideally positioned at No. 149 Cremona Road, in the heart of Ballyfermot. This impressive property has been lovingly upgraded throughout and is presented in true turnkey condition, offering a wonderful opportunity for any purchaser seeking a modern home with nothing left to do but move in. Boasting a large kitchen extension to the rear, attic conversion and a host of further upgrades, this is a home that must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\nThe location of No. 149 Cremona Road is highly convenient, with a host of amenities all within easy reach. Ballyfermot Village is close by and provides a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday conveniences, while the area is well served by an excellent selection of schools, sporting facilities and recreational amenities. There are numerous parks and green spaces nearby, while excellent transport links provide easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The M50, Chapelizod Bypass and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre are also all readily accessible, making this an ideal location for both families and commuters.\nThe property itself has been extensively upgraded and modernised over the years, resulting in a home that is presented in true turn key condition. The accommodation is thoughtfully laid out, consisting of c 100 sqm of internal floorspace comprises of an entrance hall, reception room (currently used a bedroom), living room, leading into the expansive, open plan kitchen and dining area flooded with natural light. The rear of the home features a maintenance free garden with ample space for relaxing and entertaining. Upstairs hosts two double bedrooms along with the main family bathroom. The attic has been converted and is currently used as a bedroom but can be adapted to a variety of uses if needed.\nThis exceptional property represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a modern, upgraded and genuinely turnkey home with excellent additional space and a highly convenient location. The combination of the large rear extension, attic conversion, extensive upgrades and a C BER rating makes No. 149 a particularly attractive proposition. Early viewing is highly recommended—contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing.\nFeatures\n•Approx 100 sqm of internal floorspace\n•BER C \n•3 bed/2 bath terraced home\n•Modern and extensively upgraded throughout \n•Expansive kitchen extension to rear \n•Converted attic providing additional versatile space \n•Upgraded boiler in recent years\n•Excellent standard of presentation throughout \n•Mature and highly sought-after Ballyfermot location \n•Close to Ballyfermot Village and a host of local amenities \n•Excellent schools, sporting facilities and recreational amenities nearby \n•Easy access to Dublin City Centre \n•Convenient to M50, Chapelizod Bypass and Liffey Valley \n•Ideal for first-time buyers, families and investors\nDirection \nD10 W422\n"
      },
      {
